    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mantēlum</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mantellum</span></b> , i, n.
